        "within duckdb\n",
        "\n",
        "## Tools Used\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Languages:** Python, R\n",
        "- **IDE:** Rstudio\n",
        "- **Packages:** Quarto, pandas, mplsoccer, duckdb\n",
        "\n",
        "## R Reticulate to use a specific environment\n",
        "\n",
        "This R block must come first before any python block in quarto. I found this out the hard way. \n",
        "\n",
        "```{r}\n",
